WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.139 --> 00:00:08.975 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Harold: STRATEGIZING HOW TO

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:11.578 line:78%
FIX ALL THE WORLD'S PROBLEMS.

00:00:09.075 --> 00:00:12.278 line:78%
PRESIDENT BIDEN'S CLIMATE CZAR,

00:00:11.678 --> 00:00:13.480 line:78%
FORMER SECRETARY OF STATE JOHN

00:00:12.379 --> 00:00:15.281 line:78%
KERRY, BOASTING ABOUT A PLAN TO

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:20.086 line:78%
SAVE OUR PLANET.

00:00:16.916 --> 00:00:23.923 line:78%
&gt;&gt; IT'S PRETTY EXTRAORDINARY

00:00:20.186 --> 00:00:25.558 line:78%
THAT WE, A SELECT GROUP OF HUMAN

00:00:24.024 --> 00:00:26.993 line:78%
BEINGS, BECAUSE OF WHATEVER

00:00:25.658 --> 00:00:30.663 line:78%
TOUCHED US AT SOME POINT IN OUR

00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:31.865 line:78%
LIVES, ARE ABLE TO SIT IN A ROOM

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:33.266 line:78%
AND COME TOGETHER AND ACTUALLY

00:00:31.965 --> 00:00:36.503 line:78%
TALK ABOUT SAVING THE PLANET.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:38.805 line:78%
I MEAN, IT'S SO ALMOST

00:00:36.603 --> 00:00:40.106 line:78%
EXTRATERRESTRIAL TO THINK ABOUT,

00:00:38.905 --> 00:00:41.775 line:78%
QUOTE, SAVING THE PLANET.

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:45.378 line:78%
IF YOU SAID THAT TO MOST PEOPLE,

00:00:42.042 --> 00:00:46.212 line:78%
MOST PEOPLE THEY THINK YOU'RE A

00:00:45.478 --> 00:00:48.882 line:78%
CRAZY TREE-HUGGING LEFTY

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:50.083 line:78%
LIBERAL, DO-GOODER, WHATEVER.

00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:51.251 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Harold: AND FORMER VICE

00:00:50.183 --> 00:00:52.585 line:78%
PRESIDENT AL GORE PAINTING A

00:00:51.351 --> 00:00:57.223 line:78%
RATHER DISMAL PICTURE OF WHAT

00:00:55.188 --> 00:00:57.857 line:78%
POLLUTION IS DOING TO MOTHER

00:00:57.323 --> 00:01:00.193 line:78%
EARTH.

00:00:57.957 --> 00:01:01.327 line:78%
&gt;&gt; THAT'S WHAT'S BOILING THE

00:01:00.293 --> 00:01:02.762 line:78%
OCEAN, CREATING ATMOSPHERIC

00:01:01.428 --> 00:01:03.763 line:78%
RIVERS, THE RAIN BOMBS, SUCKING

00:01:02.929 --> 00:01:04.697 line:78%
THE MOISTURE OUT OF THE LAND,

00:01:03.863 --> 00:01:11.304 line:78%
CREATING THE DROUGHTS AND

00:01:04.798 --> 00:01:14.307 line:78%
MELTING THE ICE, RAISING THE SEA

00:01:11.404 --> 00:01:18.511 line:78%
LEVEL, CLIMATE REFUGEES, 1 BILL

00:01:14.407 --> 00:01:19.279 line:78%
IN THIS CENTURY, WE HAVE TO ACT!

00:01:18.678 --> 00:01:25.852 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Harold: THE VICE PRESIDENT

00:01:19.379 --> 00:01:26.886 line:78%
HAS BEEN MOVED BY THIS ISSUE FOR

00:01:26.219 --> 00:01:29.155 line:78%
A LONG TIME.

00:01:26.986 --> 00:01:30.590 line:78%
IS THIS JUST A BUNCH OF RICH

00:01:30.356 --> 00:01:31.424 line:78%
PEOPLE?

00:01:30.757 --> 00:01:32.826 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Dana: 140,000 PRIVATE PLANES

00:01:31.524 --> 00:01:35.495 line:78%
SHOWED UP FOR THIS MEETING.

00:01:33.026 --> 00:01:37.864 line:78%
I DON'T KNOW IF THEY ATTEND THE

00:01:35.595 --> 00:01:39.466 line:78%
AL GORE'S ELECTTURE THERE.

00:01:37.997 --> 00:01:43.803 line:78%
AS TO WHAT JOHN KERRY SAID, HE

00:01:39.566 --> 00:01:44.370 line:78%
SAID ISN'T IT AMAZING THAT -- WE

00:01:43.903 --> 00:01:45.004 line:78%
WERE TOUCHED.

00:01:44.471 --> 00:01:46.639 line:78%
WE ARE THE SPECIAL ONES.

00:01:45.171 --> 00:01:48.241 line:78%
WE ARE THE ONES WHO ARE GOING --

00:01:46.739 --> 00:01:50.210 line:78%
WE GET TO SIT IN A ROOM AND TALK

00:01:48.341 --> 00:01:51.411 line:78%
ABOUT SAVING THE PLANET.

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:52.612 line:78%
WHAT ABOUT DOING SOMETHING TO

00:01:51.511 --> 00:01:54.647 line:78%
SAVE THE PLANET?

00:01:52.712 --> 00:01:56.116 line:78%
WHAT ABOUT THE PEOPLE WHO ARE

00:01:54.747 --> 00:01:58.985 line:78%
NOT TOUCHED LIKE JOHN KERRY, WHO

00:01:56.216 --> 00:02:00.053 line:78%
MIGHT TO LIVE IN NAIROBI, IN THE

00:01:59.085 --> 00:02:01.588 line:78%
CONGO, MAYBE PLACES IN AFRICA,

00:02:00.353 --> 00:02:03.923 line:78%
FOR EXAMPLE, WHERE THEY'VE BEEN

00:02:01.688 --> 00:02:05.158 line:78%
DENIED THE ABILITY TO DEVELOP

00:02:04.023 --> 00:02:06.526 line:78%
RESOURCES SO THEY CAN HAVE THEIR

00:02:05.358 --> 00:02:07.660 line:78%
OWN ENERGY AND ELECTRICITY AND

00:02:06.626 --> 00:02:09.062 line:78%
BECOME MORE INDEPENDENT, WHICH

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:11.131 line:78%
COULD LEAD TO MORE INNOVATIONS,

00:02:09.162 --> 00:02:12.599 line:78%
SO WE COULD GET TO SOMETHING

00:02:11.231 --> 00:02:13.733 line:78%
LIKE FUSION SOONER AND ALL DO

00:02:12.699 --> 00:02:17.036 line:78%
SOMETHING GOOD FOR THE PLANET ON

00:02:13.833 --> 00:02:18.505 line:78%
THAT POINT.

00:02:17.137 --> 00:02:20.039 line:78%
HERE'S THE THING, ALSO, THEY

00:02:18.605 --> 00:02:22.308 line:78%
WANT TO FOCUS ON CLIMATE CHANGE,

00:02:20.306 --> 00:02:23.843 line:78%
BUT DON'T TALK ABOUT CHINA.

00:02:22.876 --> 00:02:26.346 line:78%
THE CHINA ENERGY INVESTMENT

00:02:23.943 --> 00:02:29.382 line:78%
GROUP, THAT IS THE MAIN ENTITY

00:02:26.446 --> 00:02:29.682 line:78%
THAT'S EXPANDING USE OF COAL

00:02:29.482 --> 00:02:31.384 line:78%
THERE.

00:02:29.782 --> 00:02:31.918 line:78%
WHY WOULDN'T THEY TALK ABOUT IT

00:02:31.718 --> 00:02:35.255 line:78%
THERE?

00:02:32.018 --> 00:02:38.958 line:78%
GUESS WHAT I FOUND OUT.

00:02:35.355 --> 00:02:40.126 line:78%
THEY'RE A SPONSOR OF DAVOS.

00:02:39.125 --> 00:02:41.361 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Jeanine: OF COURSE.

00:02:40.293 --> 00:02:42.095 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Harold: JUDGE, YOU SOUND

00:02:41.461 --> 00:02:43.263 line:78%
READY.

00:02:42.262 --> 00:02:44.898 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Jeanine: CHINA IS EVERYWHERE.

00:02:43.429 --> 00:02:46.466 line:78%
CHINA IS IN THE UNIVERSITIES.

00:02:44.998 --> 00:02:48.902 line:78%
CHINA IS IN THE COLLEGES.

00:02:46.566 --> 00:02:51.070 line:78%
I MEAN, IT'S IN THE GOVERNMENT.

00:02:49.035 --> 00:02:52.138 line:78%
WE SHOULDN'T BE SURPRISED.

00:02:51.171 --> 00:02:55.842 line:78%
IT'S IN SPORTS.

00:02:52.238 --> 00:02:58.778 line:78%
IT'S IN MOVIES.

00:02:56.142 --> 00:02:59.245 line:78%
WE ARE A SELECT GROUP OF HUMAN

00:02:58.878 --> 00:03:00.747 line:78%
BEINGS.

00:02:59.345 --> 00:03:01.447 line:78%
IMAGINE, WE'RE TALKING ABOUT THE

00:03:00.847 --> 00:03:03.850 line:78%
PLANET.

00:03:01.548 --> 00:03:04.150 line:78%
THE REST OF THE PEOPLE ARE JUST

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:05.718 line:78%
RUBES.

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:07.854 line:78%
THEY DON'T KNOW ANYTHING.

00:03:05.818 --> 00:03:10.190 line:78%
THERE'S SUCH A CONDESCENDING

00:03:07.954 --> 00:03:11.124 line:78%
KIND OF ARROGANCE, THEY

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:12.959 line:78%
PONTIFICATE ABOUT THEMSELVES,

00:03:11.257 --> 00:03:14.127 line:78%
AND THE TRUTH IS THEY'RE

00:03:13.059 --> 00:03:15.295 line:78%
SPENDING OUR TAX DOLLARS.

00:03:14.427 --> 00:03:17.297 line:78%
WE'RE WORKING AND THEY'RE

00:03:15.395 --> 00:03:18.331 line:78%
SPENDING OUR MONEY.

00:03:17.397 --> 00:03:20.700 line:78%
WE'VE ALREADY SPENT A TRILLION

00:03:18.831 --> 00:03:22.502 line:78%
DOLLARS FOR RENEWABLE ENERGY.

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:24.170 line:78%
IT'S THE RICHEST COUNTRIES THAT

00:03:22.702 --> 00:03:26.239 line:78%
HAVE THE LOWEST CARBON

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:28.308 line:78%
EMISSIONS, OTHER THAN, CHINA,

00:03:26.339 --> 00:03:31.311 line:78%
WHICH IS NOT THE RICHEST YET.

00:03:28.474 --> 00:03:32.512 line:78%
BUT THE MONEY THAT'S BEING SPENT

00:03:31.411 --> 00:03:34.113 line:78%
MONEY, MONEY, MONEY -- IS MONEY

00:03:32.612 --> 00:03:35.949 line:78%
THAT THE UNITED STATES IS GIVING

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:38.051 line:78%
TO OTHER GOVERNMENTS.

00:03:36.049 --> 00:03:39.586 line:78%
SO THEY TAX US, CALL US RUBES,

00:03:38.151 --> 00:03:41.087 line:78%
AND THEN RUN AROUND IN THEIR

00:03:39.686 --> 00:03:42.522 line:78%
PRIVATE PLANES.

00:03:41.254 --> 00:03:43.823 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Harold: GREG, IN THE

00:03:42.622 --> 00:03:45.291 line:78%
GREENROOM, YOU TOLD ME, WHAT DO

00:03:43.923 --> 00:03:46.859 line:78%
YOU THINK ABOUT THIS SPEECH BY

00:03:45.391 --> 00:03:48.628 line:78%
VICE PRESIDENT GORE?

00:03:47.026 --> 00:03:49.028 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Greg: WELL, I AGREE WITH YOU

00:03:48.728 --> 00:03:50.697 line:78%
COMPLETELY.

00:03:49.128 --> 00:03:51.130 line:78%
IT WAS AN ABSOLUTE TOTAL

00:03:50.797 --> 00:03:53.366 line:78%
EMBARRASSMENT.

00:03:51.231 --> 00:03:53.866 line:78%
I'M GLAD YOU SAID THAT.

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:54.834 line:78%
[LAUGHTER]

00:03:53.967 --> 00:03:56.102 line:78%
YOU LOOK BACK IN THE SHOW,

00:03:54.934 --> 00:03:57.303 line:78%
YOU'LL FIND IT THERE.

00:03:56.202 --> 00:03:59.539 line:78%
WHY IS IT -- YOU LOOK AT AL

00:03:57.403 --> 00:04:01.374 line:78%
GORE, YOU LOOK AT JOHN KERRY.

00:03:59.806 --> 00:04:03.443 line:78%
WHY ARE THE PEOPLE SO CONCERNED

00:04:01.474 --> 00:04:04.277 line:78%
BY THE HEALTH OF THE PLANET LOOK

00:04:03.676 --> 00:04:06.546 line:78%
SO UNHEALTHY.

00:04:04.377 --> 00:04:09.182 line:78%
WHY DO THEY LOOK SO SICK?

00:04:07.247 --> 00:04:11.351 line:78%
I MEAN, THEY'RE TALKING ABOUT

00:04:09.282 --> 00:04:11.651 line:78%
SUCKING THE MOISTURE OUT OF THE

00:04:11.451 --> 00:04:13.019 line:78%
EARTH.

00:04:11.751 --> 00:04:15.255 line:78%
THAT GUY LOOKS LIKE HE NEEDS

00:04:13.119 --> 00:04:18.691 line:78%
WATERING, RIGHT?

00:04:15.355 --> 00:04:20.627 line:78%
HE'S GOT THE COMPLEXION OF A

00:04:18.791 --> 00:04:22.095 line:78%
DELAPIDATED TUMBLEWEED.

00:04:20.727 --> 00:04:23.930 line:78%
THEY'RE ALL DRIFTWOOD, ALL COME

00:04:22.195 --> 00:04:25.898 line:78%
TOGETHER FOR ONE YEAR, AND PAT

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:26.232 line:78%
EACH OTHER ON THEIR SPLINTERED

00:04:25.999 --> 00:04:28.067 line:78%
BACKS.

00:04:26.332 --> 00:04:29.068 line:78%
I'LL TELL YOU WHAT -- YOU KNOW

00:04:28.167 --> 00:04:36.843 line:78%
WHAT -- I FORGOT WHAT I WAS

00:04:29.168 --> 00:04:40.079 line:78%
GOING TO SAY.

00:04:36.943 --> 00:04:40.546 line:78%
STELTER IS THERE, TALKING ABOUT

00:04:40.179 --> 00:04:41.047 line:78%
DISINFORMATION.

00:04:40.647 --> 00:04:43.116 line:78%
ISN'T IT AMAZING?

00:04:41.147 --> 00:04:43.416 line:78%
WHAT'S HE GOING TO TALK ABOUT

00:04:43.216 --> 00:04:46.319 line:78%
NEXT?

00:04:44.083 --> 00:04:46.819 line:78%
HOW TO GET WASHBOARD ABS.

00:04:46.552 --> 00:04:48.821 line:78%
SERIOUSLY.

00:04:47.287 --> 00:04:50.290 line:78%
I'M NOT INVITED TO THESE THINGS,

00:04:48.921 --> 00:04:51.758 line:78%
BECAUSE IF YOU GO THERE WITH

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:52.292 line:78%
SOLUTION THEY CAN'T HAVE THEIR

00:04:51.858 --> 00:04:53.426 line:78%
FUN ANYMORE.

00:04:52.392 --> 00:04:54.527 line:78%
THE CLIMATE CHANGE IS GREAT,

00:04:53.526 --> 00:04:55.094 line:78%
BECAUSE EVERY YEAR THAT'S ALWAYS

00:04:54.794 --> 00:04:59.098 line:78%
THE PROBLEM.

00:04:55.194 --> 00:05:02.535 line:78%
YOU CAN STILL HAVE YOUR DAVOS

00:04:59.198 --> 00:05:04.771 line:78%
PARTY, STILL FLY IN, AND IT WILL

00:05:02.702 --> 00:05:06.506 line:78%
NEVER BE SOLVED.

00:05:04.937 --> 00:05:08.007 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Harold: THE OIL COMPANIES'

00:05:06.606 --> 00:05:09.008 line:78%
CEOs ARE IN DEMAND AT THIS

00:05:08.107 --> 00:05:10.176 line:78%
CONFERENCE FOR THE FIRST TIME IN

00:05:09.108 --> 00:05:12.879 line:78%
A LONG TIME.

00:05:10.343 --> 00:05:13.413 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Jesse: IS THAT RIGHT?

00:05:13.046 --> 00:05:17.583 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Harold: YEAH.

00:05:13.579 --> 00:05:20.320 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Jesse: I'M GLAD IS TALKING

00:05:17.684 --> 00:05:20.720 line:78%
ABOUT PEOPLE'S PHYSICAL

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:22.955 line:78%
APPEARANCES.

00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:25.325 line:78%
FULL BUSH BEAT THESE TWO GUYS,

00:05:23.056 --> 00:05:27.427 line:78%
KERRY AND GORE, THEY'RE LOSERS,

00:05:25.425 --> 00:05:29.329 line:78%
AND THEY KNOW IT, AND NOW THEY

00:05:27.527 --> 00:05:29.862 line:78%
HAVE TO BE SOMEONE ELSE'S

00:05:29.429 --> 00:05:31.331 line:78%
SAVIOR.

00:05:29.962 --> 00:05:34.267 line:78%
IF YOU'RE AL GORE, HAVE TO

00:05:31.431 --> 00:05:35.735 line:78%
CREATE A TERM CALLED A RAIN BOMB

00:05:34.434 --> 00:05:37.303 line:78%
TO CONVINCE ME TO GIVE UP MONEY

00:05:36.002 --> 00:05:38.004 line:78%
TO SAVE THE WORLD, THAT'S NOT

00:05:37.403 --> 00:05:38.871 line:78%
DOING IT.

00:05:38.104 --> 00:05:40.306 line:78%
BOILING THE OCEANS?

00:05:38.971 --> 00:05:42.008 line:78%
TALK ABOUT IT NORMALLY, AND

00:05:40.473 --> 00:05:45.845 line:78%
MAYBE I'LL BE MORE OPEN-MINDED.

00:05:42.108 --> 00:05:47.747 line:78%
A LITTLE ADVICE FOR JOHN KERRY.

00:05:45.945 --> 00:05:49.048 line:78%
YOU DON'T SAY YOU'RE SAVING THE

00:05:47.847 --> 00:05:49.115 line:78%
WORLD.

